Provides: imap-client, mail-reader
Description: private native build of the Griabuntu Mail desktop client
 Independent Convey/Geary-derived GTK email client with recipient aliases,
 local contact photos, precise received timestamps and a native new-mail tray.
 TNEF/winmail.dat support and the session-new notification flag fix are enabled.
 .
 This local Ubuntu 26.10 preview uses its own Griabuntu Mail executable,
 desktop identity and profile paths. It does not migrate existing Convey or
 Flatpak profiles or start the application during installation.
